From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 10:52:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bonito: drop the HIDL power.stats 1.0 HAL

android.hardware.power.stats@1.0 is in no framework compatibility matrix
from level 7 up, so check_vintf's unused-HAL check rejects the instance:

  android.hardware.power.stats@1.0::IPowerStats/default

Stop shipping android.hardware.power.stats@1.0-service.pixel: remove the
package, its manifest entry and the powerstats/ sources. The sources were
the only reason to carry hardware/google/pixel's deleted powerstats/
(libpixelpowerstats) back; with them gone nothing needs it. The sepolicy
stays -- hardware/google/pixel-sepolicy/powerstats is still upstream and
the qcom/common rules only reference its types. An AIDL power.stats HAL
comes back as its own patch when it is written.
---
 device.mk                                     |   4 -
 manifest.xml                                  |   9 -
 powerstats/Android.bp                         |  43 -----
 ....hardware.power.stats@1.0-service.pixel.rc |   4 -
 powerstats/service.cpp                        | 155 ------------------
 5 files changed, 215 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 powerstats/Android.bp
 delete mode 100644 powerstats/android.hardware.power.stats@1.0-service.pixel.rc
 delete mode 100644 powerstats/service.cpp

diff --git a/device.mk b/device.mk
index 3a4b3a20..156b67d0 100644
